Adapted from Anny (see docs/anny-notes.md for file references):
  - Phenotype mask-product weighting, breast (cup size, firmness) block and
    opposite-pair local modifiers with ReLU coefficients
    (src/anny/models/phenotype.py, src/anny/models/full_model.py)
  - Anthropometry: height, waist circumference (hm08 waist vertex indices),
    signed-volume mass at 980 kg/m3, BMI (src/anny/anthropometry.py)
  - Damped Gauss-Newton parameter update with finite-difference Jacobian
    (src/anny/anny_inverter.py)
  - Bone rest frames from head, tail and roll (src/anny/utils/kinematics.py)
  - Facial action blendshape integration (src/anny/models/facial_actions.py)

